                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyu Yosiani qaallichu gudda Hilkia jed'anifi qaalole isa jala hojattufi ammalle nama fullo Mana Waaqa eegu erge, aka worri miha Baalifi waaqa Ashera jed'anifi urjileeni kad'atani ch'ufa Mana Waaqa keesaa alati baasani. Hayyuuni waan kana ch'ufa dira keesa baase, d'aatu laga Kidroniti gube, duuba daara isiile Betheliti geese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni qaalole duri hayyuuni Yuda muude huji sorio waaqa d'araati hojattani dira Yudatifi lafa d'aatu Yerusalemule iti kenne ch'ufa huji suni keesaa yaase — qaalole ta Baalifi aduufi jiaafi urjiifi Bakalchale sorio baafte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni akheekha waaqa Ashera jed'anile Mana Waaqa keesa fuud'e, dira keesa alati baase, laga Kidroni keesati gube, d'ukeese d'uke sunile lafa nama iti awaalaniti firfirse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle mana nad'eeni sharmut'i iti galtu ka d'aatu Mana Waaqa balleese. (Artiti nad'eeni woya waaqa Ashera jed'aniini kad'atani hod'ite mid'aasiti.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni qaalole dira Yuda keesa jirtu ch'ufa Yerusalemutini d'ufe, duuba fulla sorio Waaqa d'ara iti baasani ta lafa suni ch'ufa keesa jirtu yake t'ureese, ammalle fulla waaqa d'ara iti kad'atani ta harka bita, d'aatu fullo Yoshuani guddaani dira suni jaarellee ch'ach'abse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaalole suni Mana Waaqa keesa hojachu d'owani, ammo akuma qaalole taani d'ibi qit'a bukho inqamne nyaati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
